WEBVTT

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:57.280
Hilander72
Ripped by

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:07.710
Rushe...

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:17.960
What?! A hundred of our men
are no match for Kall-Su?!

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:18.840
Aye...

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:23.800
After Judus castle, Witos Neiki
castle is the strongest, but...

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.450
...will it fall
to Kall-Su alone?

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:34.280
Farus-Kova Kiru-em-o
Raidza-rai Fam-fatarao Vido.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:38.310
Frozen soil! Glaciers!
Rage forth! VIS-KAYA!

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:53.950
<i>Prince, you are</i>
<i>lucky to be able...</i>

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.560
<i>...to sleep forever within</i>
<i>a beautiful glacier of ice.</i>

00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:01.040
<i>That is preferable to what</i>
<i>Abigail's disgusting undead army...</i>

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.410
<i>...is doing to Iron Maydon.</i>

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:21.930
Judus... Witos Neiki...
Iron Maydon...

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:25.200
Three of the seals
binding Ansla-Sax...

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:28.010
...the God of Destruction,
are now in our hands.

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:30.850
Now, then...

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:36.010
The final remaining
seal is in Meta-Rikana...

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:39.810
...and that meddler,
Dark Schneider, is dead!

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:43.040
Our ideals are
about to be realized.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.310
Will we live to
see tomorrow's sunset?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:55.760
Highness...

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:58.860
Dark clouds even
thicker than before...

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.950
...are building in
the direction of Judus.

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:03.980
The seals holding the God of
Destruction are coming together.

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:08.260
The grotesque
evil god Ansla-Sax.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:11.030
If it revives,
it will destroy the world.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:15.580
Just as what happened to
the old world 400 years ago...

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:18.530
...at the height of its prosperity,
when it was destroyed in seven days.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:23.870
Man is an
insignificant creature...

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.530
...but we must not be
lost to the flames.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:29.670
We must not allow them
to get the final seal.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:31.560
The final seal?

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:35.430
Yes, Princess Sheela.
Here in Meta-Rikana.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.760
- Is the seal inside this castle?
- Yes.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:42.290
Within...
Within its princess' body.

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:44.300
My body?

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.960
I believe the
enemy will launch...

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:49.080
...an all-out attack
with you as their target.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:56.050
But now Meta-Rikana no longer has
the military strength to stop them.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:58.420
Geo...

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:02.780
I have a favor to ask.
If things don't work out...

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:06.460
- Then... Kill Sheela!
- But!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.060
This isn't a question of
one person's life anymore!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.610
We of the royal family have
been entrusted with protecting...

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:14.330
...the seal since the
old world was destroyed...

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:16.150
...and we have until today.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.420
If we can't protect the seal...

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:21.410
...then what is the
purpose of the royal family?!

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:31.880
<i>If only... If only</i>
<i>that man were still alive.</i>

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.300
Rushe...

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:41.690
Rushe, you never paid
me back that 500 yen...

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:46.210
That's not right!

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:09.940
Darsh...

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.980
<i>Darsh, who was my</i>
<i>father and my lover...</i>

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:21.300
<i>To save me, you...</i>
<i>You sacrificed your own life.</i>

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:26.170
<i>My life was saved</i>
<i>by the one I love...</i>

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:30.990
<i>I'll fight and fight</i>
<i>and try to live on!</i>

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.950
<i>Until I've had my vengeance!</i>

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:49.260
Bi all shendohl, out
besight boond meirah!

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:53.520
<i>The seals are breaking!</i>

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:58.950
Break the seals and
give your power to me now!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.490
Princess Sheela?

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.690
Hurry and fetch Master Geo!

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.030
- The undead army!
- They've finally come!

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.500
<i>I, Abigail,</i>
<i>the prophet of Hades himself...</i>

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:25.170
<i>...have come for the final seal!</i>

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.370
What?! Princess Sheela?!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:36.480
We're weak here.
Send for more troops...

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:37.660
Captain!

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:40.300
We have a report
from the western line.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:45.700
Th- The enemy numbers 200,000.
The western line has been wiped out.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.700
What?! Hmm...

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:50.500
But we are the
knights of Meta-Rikana!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.940
We will defend the castle
even after the last man falls!

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.730
Well... As you wish!

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.110
Y- You?!

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:08.310
Thunder Empress Arshes Nei!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.530
I'll handle things here.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:14.100
You have only one life.
Don't sacrifice it needlessly.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:15.960
Lady Nei...

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.730
Get going!
You defend the castle!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:24.090
<i>I leave this to you, Lady Nei!</i>

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.110
Prince of the underworld,
great Toni-Mua!

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:39.140
Fulfill the ancient covenant!
Suman-doa Sute-ru! RIOT!

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.600
I know you're here, Abigail!

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:52.870
Abigail!

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.460
Long time, no see, Arshes Nei.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:04.130
You're looking well, too...
Abigail!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:10.320
Arshes Nei! Are you trying
to defy the great will...

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:13.600
...of destruction which God has
chosen to purify the world with?

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.730
The will of destruction?
You!

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:19.470
You mean you never
intended to use Ansla-Sax...

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:21.290
...to create a
utopia in this world?!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:24.750
Only now you see...

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:29.430
My ambition extends further
than even you can imagine.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.990
It is for destruction!
The destruction of all creation!

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:36.530
You monster! What's the point of
destroying the world, Abigail?!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:41.930
Slayerd-slayerd Balmor!
Lightning of darkness! Bal Volt!

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.840
Nei, destruction has
been my mission and...

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.560
...the reason for my existence
since the days of the old world.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.180
I'm not like you,
who has nothing.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.030
Shut up!

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:02.370
I have no more words
to describe the glory of...

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.330
...the God of Destruction to
an ignorant worm like you!

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:07.450
Go and die at the hands of a monster
created by the God of Destruction!

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:19.520
A cyclops?! Do you
think a monster like this...

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.540
...is all you need to stop me?!

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.940
Dragon deathstrike!

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:34.170
What?!

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:38.140
This isn't an ordinary cyclops!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:40.930
Abigail, what the
hell are you up to?!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.970
<i>There's no way you</i>
<i>can beat it. No way!</i>

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.130
Abigail!

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:54.760
<i>Rejoice, Arshes Nei!</i>
<i>I will send you...</i>

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:57.880
<i>...to where Dark</i>
<i>Schneider now exists!</i>

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:00.400
<i>To the one that you love.</i>

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:04.740
<i>Darsh...</i>

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:10.300
Darsh?

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:14.570
Hi. It's been a while, Nei.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:15.350
Gara!

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:17.910
I owed him one.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:22.550
Ninja Master Gara
and his army of 2000 ninja!

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.340
We're here to help!

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:35.700
Princess Sheela...
If this keeps up...

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.830
That spell!

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:52.460
In the name of myself,
the Great Priest Geo Note Soto...

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:57.670
...I summon thee from the
distant past, Ung Vay!

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:01.940
Stop it! Are you trying
to kill Princess Sheela?!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.130
Master Geo!

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:06.090
Master Geo...

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:09.020
What's that?

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.950
A light from the chapel...

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:14.190
What?!

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:24.500
I've never felt such evil power...

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.370
<i>Ansla-Sax's eyes are opening.</i>

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:38.860
<i>Impossible!</i>
<i>Dark Schneider's eyes!</i>

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:46.050
What's with you?!
Didn't you come to help me?!

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:47.970
Just relax.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.480
What's the point in killing
it while we're off screen?!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.120
Watch this, folks!

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:59.400
Let's go! True Demon Sword!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:09.870
Next up,
Demon Wave Motion Sword!

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.370
- And that's that.
- Gara!

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.690
It's regenerating?!

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:25.990
Is this creature unkillable?

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:29.260
<i>Oh, yes. That must</i>
<i>have surprised you.</i>

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:30.560
Where are you, Abigail?!

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:34.600
<i>Do you like</i>
<i>my lovely cyclops?</i>

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:38.910
<i>I'd be so disappointed</i>
<i>if you didn't like him.</i>

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:42.950
<i>Especially after I used tissue from</i>
<i>the God of Destruction to create him!</i>

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:44.050
What?!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.240
Tissue from Ansla-Sax?!

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:54.450
Nei!

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:57.270
Gara!

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:02.340
Now feel the
punishment for defying God!

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.800
The smash of God's Hammer!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:08.580
What?!

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.800
<i>I had a feeling this might happen.</i>

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.280
<i>Just a feeling!</i>
<i>Just a feeling, but!</i>

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.070
Rushe!

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.070
R- Rushe!

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:24.340
What's?

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:28.700
I don't believe it...

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.620
His heart is
regenerating out of nothing...

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:35.480
<i>Sheer will... He's reviving</i>
<i>himself by force of sheer will?</i>

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:38.690
But... This is as if
he were responding...

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:42.320
...to the revival of the
God of Destruction, isn't it?

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:02.750
Dark Schneider?! He's reviving?!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:09.530
Could it be in response to the
God of Destruction's revival?

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.350
Dark...

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:34.770
What's happening?!
The heart's falling apart!

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.910
R- Rushe...

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:42.840
<i>It looks like you're both</i>
<i>about at the end of your ropes.</i>

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.090
Gara...

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:45.980
<i>Does it hurt, Gara?</i>

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:49.470
<i>Then allow me to release</i>
<i>you from your pain.</i>

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:54.910
Like hell! Nei, I'll
get you out of there...

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:04.820
Gara!

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:14.140
Stop it, Gara!
You... What about you?

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:19.100
If I don't,
we'll both die anyway!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.930
- But...
- Be quiet!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.100
I have to concentrate.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.580
But...

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.980
Nei, you must...

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.770
You must survive!

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:45.800
GARA!!!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:51.210
<i>Such a lovely friendship.</i>
<i>Rejoice, Gara.</i>

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.640
<i>You will be the first to become</i>
<i>one with the flesh of the cyclops!</i>

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:58.750
I can't say I'm too
thrilled about that idea.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.460
Master Gara!
Save Master Gara!

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.670
Right!

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:05.390
You idiots!
You can't handle this thing!

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:13.830
NO!!!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.620
Damn it all!

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:29.000
That's enough!
Stop it! Stop it!

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:35.920
Master Gara, take this!
Take Murasame!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:45.770
You... You!!!
I won't let you live!!!

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.010
Is he?!

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:14.820
That sword... That sword draws on
the life of the one who uses it...

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:16.150
Gara!

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:29.260
Gara, don't!
That sword... That sword!

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.700
You're a sore loser.

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:34.180
<i>That's just how I am...</i>

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.920
Kei-Un-Ki Ninja Strike!

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:48.220
Wha... What the?!

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:53.270
You did it!
You did it, Gara!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.530
Gara!

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:06.880
Gara!

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.850
My... My cyclops!

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.600
It's still 1/3 alive!

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:20.170
O great god Ansla-Sax!
Grant me your power!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:22.690
Grant me your power once more!

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:26.380
Gara, speak to me!
Gara! Gara!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:28.890
Darsh...

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.830
DARSH!!!

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:38.270
Cyclops! In the name of Ansla-Sax,
God of Destruction, REVIVE!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.980
Dark Schneider
should revive soon.

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.950
No, his heart
still isn't beating.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:59.930
Isn't there anything
we can do, Master Geo?

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.710
We don't dare approach
that evil aura of his.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:05.490
Hey! Rushe, wake up!
Are you gonna sleep all day?!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:09.930
Cut this out and wake up!
Wake up...

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.830
...or I'll kick your ass!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:18.500
I'M SORRY!!!

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:25.440
Ow... Damned cyclops...

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:32.030
It's even stronger and lovelier
than before, don't you think?

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:34.390
Now you die, Arshes Nei!

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:43.730
Don't you lay a hand
on my beautiful daughter!

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:47.660
D-D-DARK SCHNElDER?!!!!!!

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:50.320
Boo-ray Boorayn Dead...

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.390
Obey your blood oath, come
forth from the land of Abadon!

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:56.910
Fire of Gehena, become a fiery
blast and burn everything around us!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:59.210
EXODUS!!!

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:07.920
Darsh?!

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:12.350
What's wrong, Nei?
Why such a long face?

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:14.890
Darsh! Darsh, is that you?!

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:19.710
You get to see some wild
things if you live long enough.

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:20.680
Gara!

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:39.910
Jeez, it's not like that's
gonna do you any good.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.840
So, you've come, Dark Schneider!

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:46.720
<i>The foolish wizard who</i>
<i>interferes with our revival!</i>

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:49.770
Oh, shut up!
How dare you start doing...

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:52.880
...whatever you wanted
to when I wasn't around!

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:54.380
You son of a bitch!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.770
For the sin of
disobedience against God...

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:59.950
...you shall pay
with your own blood!

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:04.780
God? You'd call some weapon
that destroyed the old world God?

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:09.070
Don't make me laugh! If there's
any "God" in this world...

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:10.840
...it's ME!

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:15.110
You're so conceited
it's almost funny!

00:22:15.590 --> 00:22:17.590
That's my line, pal!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:20.990
Para-Nodo-ii...

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:24.970
Dark Schneider!

00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:28.510
Cy-col! Cy-col!

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:31.440
You of the earth, fall to ruin,
and return to the dust!

00:22:32.650 --> 00:22:37.580
It's too late! You can't make it
with that spell, Dark Schneider!

00:22:37.820 --> 00:22:39.260
- Gara!
- Right!

00:22:42.620 --> 00:22:44.880
You annoying flies!
You're too late!

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:47.990
<i>Zuocidal Den-Denjia!</i>

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:53.330
Eda Eter Nal Idol!!!

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:03.390
<i>Now I'll finish you,</i>
<i>Dark Schneider!</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:08.010
<i>I'll crush your heart myself!</i>

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:17.560
Now you can't
revive yourself again...

00:23:17.590 --> 00:23:20.020
...with your puny tricks,
Dark Schneider!

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:24.160
What the?

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:28.880
It's just a shell!

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:31.970
Para-Nodo-ii Formo Blooru...

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:32.970
What?!

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:39.380
Never say die, Eter Nal Idol,
heaven's hell...

00:23:40.030 --> 00:23:40.800
Darsh!

00:23:41.890 --> 00:23:43.900
<i>How?! Dark Schneider...</i>

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:51.390
<i>I see! When it happened, he</i>
<i>shrank himself into his left arm!</i>

00:23:51.420 --> 00:23:52.690
What a guy!

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:55.430
Dy-omi Giza-oji!

00:23:55.460 --> 00:23:57.660
Impossible! I...

00:23:57.700 --> 00:24:00.360
I, who carry on the
will of the old world?!

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:05.290
Go to hell, Abigail!

00:24:05.600 --> 00:24:08.010
BRAG-ZA-HARS!

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:23.810
Curse you, Dark Schneider!
Next time, I swear I'll!

00:24:35.710 --> 00:24:40.260
Did we do it?
Is the cyclops finally dead?

00:24:44.630 --> 00:24:47.180
Darsh... Darsh...

00:24:50.210 --> 00:24:52.720
Darsh! Darsh!

00:24:52.750 --> 00:24:56.080
There, there.
Be a good girl and don't cry.

00:24:56.440 --> 00:24:59.340
Didn't I tell you? Someone as
handsome as I can't die.

00:24:59.850 --> 00:25:00.750
Besides...

00:25:01.460 --> 00:25:03.570
With two of the Four Lords
of Chaos on my side...

00:25:03.600 --> 00:25:05.900
...I knew I'd be able
to come back to life.

00:25:06.770 --> 00:25:08.960
You're as reckless as ever.

00:25:11.490 --> 00:25:14.360
Rushe-e-e-e!

00:25:17.720 --> 00:25:18.780
Rushe...

00:25:22.430 --> 00:25:23.490
Yoko...

00:25:28.580 --> 00:25:30.540
Here's your 500 yen back.

00:25:37.510 --> 00:25:38.480
You nut...

00:25:42.080 --> 00:25:44.410
All right, people!

00:25:45.140 --> 00:25:49.160
It's time for the heroes
to return in triumph!

00:25:54.550 --> 00:26:00.130
<i>Dark Schneider... Please, protect</i>
<i>this castle. And also...</i>

00:26:02.520 --> 00:26:04.710
<i>The danger has passed for now.</i>

00:26:04.740 --> 00:26:07.910
<i>However, the war will go on.</i>

00:26:07.940 --> 00:26:12.100
<i>These hopeless</i>
<i>and unavoidable battles...</i>

00:26:12.540 --> 00:26:15.850
<i>For now, we have no choice</i>
<i>but to keep fighting them...</i>

00:26:24.260 --> 00:26:26.560
It's fallen back to sleep.

00:26:28.120 --> 00:26:30.110
Dark Schneider...

00:26:30.140 --> 00:26:33.490
I'll teach you what it
means to make me your enemy.

00:26:34.450 --> 00:26:38.170
The real war is yet to come.
